<title>USA: Chrysler sets unchanged quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Chrysler sets unchanged quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp on Thursday said its board declared a quarterly dividend of $0.40 a share on its common stock, unchanged from the previous amount.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 15 to shareholders of record March 15.</p>
<p>The board also declared a dividend of $1.15625 per depositary share, each representing 1/10th of a share of the company's series A convertible preferred stock, payable April 15, to shareholders of record on March 15.</p>
